      "label": "Video",
      "info": "Takes the place of the image when set. Plays muted and on a loop, with no controls, cropped to the same shape as the picture would be — so the column keeps its height whatever the proportions of your file. A visitor who has asked their device for reduced motion sees the poster instead."
    },
